v 3
d equaids: AIDS and QUAIDS demand systems for survey data - aggregate elasticities with analytic standard errors (robust, cluster, svy)
d
d Author: Abdelkrim Araar, Universite Laval / PEP
d Support: aabd@ecn.ulaval.ca
d Version : 0.1.0 (development)
d License : GPL-3.0-or-later
d
d Almost ideal demand system (Deaton and Muellbauer 1980) and its quadratic
d extension (Banks, Blundell and Lewbel 1997), demographics by Ray's scaling,
d estimated by iterated FGNLS (Gauss-Newton, analytic Jacobian, in Mata).
d Aggregate elasticities (default), at the means and household mean; analytic
d standard errors from influence functions, robust, by cluster or by survey
d design (svyset). Diagnostics before estimation (equaidsdiag), estat
d diagnostics, Engel curves after estimation (estat engel), dialog box.
d
d Requires: Stata 14.2 or later
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260925
d
f src/equaids.ado
f src/equaids.sthlp
f src/equaids.dlg
f src/equaids_estat.ado
f src/_equaids_tabstars.ado
f src/equaidsdiag.ado
f src/equaidsdiag.sthlp
